idayCalendar" sap:label="Holiday Calendar" sap:creatable="false" sap:updatable="false" sap:upsertable="false" sap:deletable="false"><Documentation><Summary>HolidayCalendar</Summary><LongDescription>A holiday calendar defines all relevant public holidays for an employee. Each holiday needs to be created separately in the Admin Tools by choosing Manage Time Off Structures. Afterwards, the holiday can be used for all relevant dates - for example, in the case of Christmas Day, December 25 2014, 2015, 2016, and so on. For each holiday, you can define whether it is a full holiday, half-holiday, or a normal working day at your business.</LongDescription><sap:tagcollection><sap:tag>Employee Central (EC)</sap:tag><sap:tag>EC - Time Off</sap:tag></sap:tagcollection></Documentation></EntitySet><EntitySet Name="CurrencyExchangeRate" EntityType="SFOData.CurrencyExchangeRate" sap:label="Currency Exchange Rate" sap:creatable="true" sap:updatable="true" sap:upsertable="true" sap:deletable="true"><Documentation><Summary>The Currency Exchange Rate</Summary><LongDescription>The entity CurrencyExchangeRate is created to provide information about Currency Conversions in EC. An exchange rate is how much it costs to exchange one source currency for another target currency</LongDescription><sap:tagcollection><sap:tag>Employee Central (EC)</sap:tag></sap:tagcollection></Documentation></EntitySet><EntitySet Name="PerGlobalInfoNLD" EntityType="SFOData.PerGlobalInfoNLD" sap:label="Global Information" sap:creatable="false" sap:updatable="false" sap:upsertable="true" sap:deletable="false"><Documentation><Summary></Summary><LongDescription></LongDescription><sap:tagcollection><sap:tag>Employee Central (EC)</sap:tag></sap:tagcollection></Documentation></EntitySet><EntitySet Name="GoalAchievements" EntityType="SFOData.GoalAchievements" sap:label="GoalAchievements" sap:creatable="false" sap:updatable="false" sap:upsertable="false" sap:deletable="false"><Documentation><Summary>SuccessLine's GoalAchie